With this change:

- Any imported monitor that carries a `sliderMin`/`sliderMax` field from the VM will now render with that exact range.
- New 3.0 sliders (which still don’t have `sliderMin`/`sliderMax` set by the VM) will continue to fall back to the pre-existing props and ultimately to the 0–100 defaults in the child. 

Feel free to extend this further by computing `isDiscrete` from `sliderMin`/`sliderMax` or adding a true “range‐edit” dialog, but at minimum this patch restores VM‐driven ranges for imported sliders.
